  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Commercial Arithmetic III: a pay rise into the 30 per cent band</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 2.4 (e): Find the PAYE before and after a pay rise that crosses into the 30% band, judge a claim that take-home pay falls, and find the change in take-home pay.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
